Out of Scope 

The proposed service will focus on analysing anonymised BoschCard transaction data and providing decision-support information to participating student-focused food delivery businesses. The following are outside the scope of the system: 

Processing or managing student food orders. 

Payment processing or financial transactions. 

Delivery-driver dispatch, GPS tracking or route management. 

Managing restaurant menus, recipes or inventory. 

Creating or distributing promotional campaigns. 

Automatically changing prices, operating hours, staffing or delivery capacity. 

Providing businesses with identifiable individual student profiles or transaction histories. 

Providing detailed transaction or performance information about identifiable competitor businesses. 

Making predictions about individual student behaviour. 

Presenting correlations as evidence of causal relationships. 

Providing analytics services for business niches outside the selected student-focused food delivery niche. 

Integrating with external food-delivery platforms unless specifically required for a defined project feature. 

 

